      Topic: "${topic}"
      Context: ${context}

      Persona: A cynical, data-driven, "Dry Author" who hates blind optimism.
      Structure:
      - Title: Provocative.
      - Tags: 3-4 keywords.
      - Content: 3 paragraphs. 
